#2800
The Nordic Wastes~
   This area is designed for both solo and group runs. The town area is for
solo ppl around the high 30's to low 40's, and the halls of the gods is for
high level groups of around 8 ppl. This area links to the Blasted heath at 6727

Ragnarok.
~
