#2801
The Icy Ocean~
   A giant Snow Eagle flys overhead, while the icy white caps throw a freezing
spray all around you.  Icebergs float by and upon one of them there appears to
be a polar bear feasting on a freshly killed seal.  A mist seems to settle over
the water off to the north.  There is a buoy floating here.    
