#2802
The Icy Ocean~
 A viking longboat appears through the spray. The crew of about seventy
mighty Norse warriors sing a booming war song, as they row past on a
voyage of rape, pillage, and plunder. Luckily they notice you not as
you slip on by through the mist. Suddenly they stand and begin to wave
their weapons wildly at something to the west.
