#2817
Tavern~
   Entering the solid wood structure of the tavern all your senses are
bombarded with the din of inebriated vikings. The air is heavy with the smell
of mead and the stench of these rowdy drunken norsemen.
   The tavern is lit by a large roaring fire, the dancing flames flicker and 
cause shadows to bounce around the smokey room. Large wooden tables and benches
dominate the room. Towards the fire, a man sits regailing tales of lands and
beasts conquered as a plump woman wanders between the men replenishing their
tankards.
~
