#2833
Volcanic Lake~
   On leaving the tunnel you find yourself on the great expanse of a Volcanic
Lake. Steam rises from the water and there are open vents bubbling with molten
lava spotted around the lake shore. 
   It takes a second for you to realise that there is no mist covering the sky.
The sun is shining brightly high overhead in a beautiful blue sky. On the far
side of the lake there looks to be a collection of burnt hulks alining the 
northern shore.
~
